  "privacyTitle": "Privacy & data",
  "privacyBody1": "This app saves your name, birth details, studio charts, model settings, saved connections, and hidden profiles on this device. Client API keys stay in memory. When you choose to generate an interpretation, calculated chart evidence is sent to your selected model provider. Names, exact birth dates and places are omitted from that evidence. Resetting local data does not erase provider records or the local server’s API key. Invitations and local message drafts are also stored on this device and included in your data export. Agent questions and recent conversation turns are sent to a connected model when you ask; this includes information you type.",
  "privacyBody2": "Local storage is not encrypted. On a shared device, clear your data when you are done. Clearing browser or app data also removes your profile.",
  "privacyBody3": "Resetting clears your personal details and saved preferences, then returns to the sample profile.",
